## Decisions Made
- Added `e2e_mock_ralph_script(ralph_bin: &Path)` in `src/validate/mock_scripts.rs:321` to hard-bind execution to the provided absolute binary via `exec <absolute> auto "$@"`, with shell-safe quoting to avoid PATH recursion.
